-- ============================================================================
-- Industry catalog seed (tenant 100001): 10 industries, 40 leaf categories,
-- 1200 SPUs, 2400 variant SKUs, media, SPU specifications and price-list rows.
-- ============================================================================
-- Every environment (development, test, staging, demo, production) applies this
-- file through the shop module's seed set: the manifest has `seedOnBoot: true`
-- and install/upgrade runs migrations before the same seed profile. The whole
-- file is generated by PostgreSQL `generate_series`, so it stays small and
-- deterministic while producing the bootstrap catalog an operator expects.
--
-- Idempotent: rows are keyed by reserved seed ids and upserted on the primary
-- key, so a re-run neither duplicates nor drifts. Runtime snowflake ids stay far
-- above every reserved id (see database/contract/schema.yaml).
--
-- MONEY: CNY, exponent 2; a price of 399 yuan is 39900.
-- VARIANTS: every SPU has two colour variants and one package specification.
-- INVENTORY: physical SKUs declare `quantity` tracking; no stock quantity is
-- seeded (operational data owned by sdkwork-inventory).
-- ============================================================================

